Auth.js currently recommends installing next-auth@beta, creating an auth.ts config file, and wiring /app/api/auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts. It also requires AUTH_SECRET. 
 Credentials auth is the right fit here because you want your own friend signup/login with email/password. 

1. Install packages
npm install next-auth@beta bcryptjs zod
Generate the auth secret:

