Run:

npx prisma generate
npm run dev
Then test:

/sign-up without invite code -> should fail
/signup with invite code -> should create user and log in
/login -> should work
/picks while logged out -> redirects to /login
/picks while logged in -> shows active event
/admin as normal user -> redirects to /picks
/admin as ADMIN -> allowed, once we build the admin page
Next step after this is Step 3: update /api/picks/submit so picks are saved to the logged-in user and locked permanently.


