│        └─ [...nextauth]/
│           └─ route.ts
├─ auth.ts
├─ package.json
└─ .env
Common mistake: since your project folder is also named app, the route files must go inside:

/Documents/PickFights/app/app/signup/page.tsx
not:

/Documents/PickFights/app/signup/page.tsx
