Save it.

Then refresh:

http://localhost:3000/picks
Or fix it with SQL
In Neon SQL editor, run:

UPDATE "Event"
SET 
  "isActive" = true,
  "status" = 'OPEN',
  "lockAt" = '2026-12-31T23:59:00.000Z'
WHERE "slug" = 'ufc-328';
Why /test-event works
Your old /test-event page is most likely finding the event by a hardcoded slug like ufc-328.

The new /picks page is finding the event by:

active event only
So right now /picks is saying: “I don’t see any active event.”

Once you mark that event active/open, it should appear.


