For the profile pic, this version stores a small compressed image data URL in Neon. That keeps it simple: no S3/Cloudinary yet. For a friend group, this is totally fine. Later, if the app gets bigger, we can swap profile images to Cloudinary/S3.

1. Update prisma/schema.prisma
In your User model, add these two fields:

displayName  String?
imageUrl     String? @db.Text
So your full User model should look like this:

model User {
  id           String           @id @default(cuid())
  email        String           @unique
  username     String           @unique
  displayName  String?
  imageUrl     String?          @db.Text
  passwordHash String?
  role         UserRole         @default(USER)
  createdAt    DateTime         @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime         @default(now()) @updatedAt
  submissions  PickSubmission[]
}
